sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM Engine<br/>ZMQ Publisher
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ Subscriber<br/>tcp://5557
    participant EventPool as KV Event Pool<br/>(kvevents)
    participant KVIndex as KV Block Index<br/>(kvblock)
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>6379/TCP
    participant Router as llm-d Endpoint Picker<br/>(External Router)
    participant Online as Online Scoring Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant gRPC as IndexerService<br/>50051/TCP gRPC
    participant Tokenizer as UDS Tokenizer<br/>/tmp/tokenizer UDS
    participant Reconciler as Pod Reconciler<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over vLLM,Redis: KV Cache Event Ingestion Flow

    vLLM->>ZMQ: Publish KV cache events<br/>topic: kv@<br/>block alloc/evict/clear
    ZMQ->>EventPool: Consume events<br/>(configurable concurrency)
    EventPool->>KVIndex: Update index<br/>(add/remove/clear blocks)
    KVIndex->>Redis: Store/delete KV block entries<br/>TCP 6379 (TLS via rediss://)
    Redis-->>KVIndex: Acknowledgment

    Note over Router,Redis: HTTP Scoring Request Flow

    Router->>Online: POST /score_completions<br/>or /score_chat_completions<br/>No Auth, Port 8080
    Online->>KVIndex: Query prefix cache hits
    KVIndex->>Redis: Lookup cached blocks<br/>TCP 6379
    Redis-->>KVIndex: Block match data
    KVIndex-->>Online: Prefix hit scores
    Online-->>Router: JSON scored pod rankings

    Note over gRPC,Redis: gRPC Scoring Flow

    Router->>gRPC: GetPodScores RPC<br/>No Auth, Port 50051
    gRPC->>KVIndex: Query scores
    KVIndex->>Redis: Lookup cached blocks
    Redis-->>KVIndex: Block data
    KVIndex-->>gRPC: Scores
    gRPC-->>Router: PodScores response

    Note over Tokenizer: Tokenization Sidecar Flow (in KServe Pod)

    Router->>Tokenizer: Tokenize RPC<br/>UDS /tmp/tokenizer<br/>Pod-scoped access
    Tokenizer-->>Router: Token IDs

    Note over Reconciler,K8sAPI: Pod Lifecycle Tracking

    K8sAPI->>Reconciler: Pod watch events<br/>HTTPS 6443, ServiceAccount auth
    Reconciler->>KVIndex: Remove stale entries<br/>(on pod deletion)
    KVIndex->>Redis: Delete entries

    Note over Online,OTel: Observability

    Online->>OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC (insecure)
    gRPC->>OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC (insecure)
